# Factory board measures

acme/widgets, project 2. Weeks 2026-10-05 to 2026-10-25 (Monday 00:00 UTC), read at 2026-10-22T12:00:00Z.

Read from the board's status changes and the timelines of its issues and pull requests;
factory/measure/README.md defines every measure. A signal names who caught what a role
passed. It is not a defect count.

